      "t": "Как ты ее вообще завел?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Ну, чем открыл, тем и завел.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ты зеркало починил?",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go back through the exchange around The Stolen Car line by line and unpack how the Russian works.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Постучаться не учили?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Didn't they teach you to knock?' Chef Barinov meets her intrusion with sarcasm. He asks if she forgot her manners.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Я звоню в полицию.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am calling the police.' Elena gets straight to the point. She announces she is contacting the authorities.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Где моя машина?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Where is my car?' She demands answers about her missing property. Elena wants to know where her vehicle went.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Понятия не имею.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have no idea.' Chef Barinov pleads ignorance. He claims he knows absolutely nothing about it.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Значит так, мне все это надоело.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is it. I have had enough.' Elena loses her patience completely. She declares she is sick of his games.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Если через пять минут...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If in five minutes...' She issues a strict deadline. Elena gives him exactly five minutes to fix the situation.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "моей машины не будет на месте...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My car is not back...' She lays out the condition. Elena expects her property returned to its rightful place.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "я заявляю об угоне.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am reporting it stolen.' She states the consequence clearly. Elena promises to officially report a theft.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Вы меня хорошо поняли?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you understand me?' Elena demands confirmation. She asks if he fully comprehends her threat.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Все.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is all.' She ends the conversation abruptly. Elena declares she has nothing more to say.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Перед тем, как я тебя убью...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Before I kill you...' Chef Barinov turns his wrath on Fedya. He promises violent retribution.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "ответь мне на вопрос.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Answer one question.' He demands a single answer before acting. Barinov tells Fedya to explain himself.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ты зачем увез машину?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why did you take the car?' Chef Barinov asks the crucial question. He wants to know why Fedya moved the vehicle.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Шеф, у него не получилось приехать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, he could not make it.' Fedya offers a weak excuse. He blames someone else for failing to show up. Now let's listen to the whole conversation again from start to finish.",
